  "reflectionText": "Mary lifted her voice in Elizabeth's house and said: my soul magnifies the Lord. He has done great things for me. He has scattered the proud, brought down princes, lifted up the lowly, filled the hungry. How does a young woman in a hill-country house sing a song that turns the order of the kingdoms upside down?"
